{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kenopsia</strong> is an experience of quiet revelation, a journey through hollow places where the past lingers and the unseen watches. Empty corridors stretch endlessly, bathed in fading light. Forgotten sanctuaries hum with a presence just beyond perception. Somewhere in the stillness, something listens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You walk alone, yet you are not abandoned. The silence is filled with questions, yours, or someone else\u2019s? The walls breathe with echoes of words unspoken, answers waiting to be found. Every step draws you deeper into a dialogue without words, where understanding is felt rather than heard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is something here. It has always been here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you listen? Will you speak? And if you do\u2026 will it answer?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3524910?t=1745182837","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524910/c92e6671fbacb269087bfb1be7513bd42023815d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745182837","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524910/48a8ed2b7e1aef5963f4b2b8b5b0e6e3baf25b80/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745182837","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524910/48a8ed2b7e1aef5963f4b2b8b5b0e6e3baf25b80/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745182837","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kenopsia</strong> is an experience of quiet revelation, a journey through hollow places where the past lingers and the unseen watches. Empty corridors stretch endlessly, bathed in fading light. Forgotten sanctuaries hum with a presence just beyond perception. Somewhere in the stillness, something listens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You walk alone, yet you are not abandoned. The silence is filled with questions, yours, or someone else\u2019s? The walls breathe with echoes of words unspoken, answers waiting to be found. Every step draws you deeper into a dialogue without words, where understanding is felt rather than heard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is something here. It has always been here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you listen? Will you speak? And if you do\u2026 will it answer?</p>","developers":["mjiohrin"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524910/7b187d7a903cee93ec76c9cf537a07626b5fb9b6/header.jpg?t=1745182837","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"@ mjiohrin 2025","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18.04 or later, or any modern Linux distribution<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core 2.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.3 compatible GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.11 (El Capitan) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel ( Dual-core 2.0 GHz )<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><l